/F1 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0. g
54. 361.375 Td
(The operational definition under 28 C.F.R. § 0.85\(l\) governs the FBI’s primary investigative mandate across all terrorism) Tj
T* (matters within U.S. jurisdiction. It focuses on the unlawful use of force or violence against persons or property to) Tj
T* (intimidate or coerce a government or civilian population for political or social goals.) Tj
ET
