54. 708. Td
(By decoupling enforcement from statutory criminal predicates, platforms penalize pre-operational speech, ideological) Tj
T* (propaganda, aesthetic subcultures \(e.g., terrorwave imagery\), and extremist manifestos. Platforms enforce content bans) Tj
T* (based on qualitative assessments of potential offline harm, operating proactive algorithmic removals and hash-database) Tj
T* (matching via the Global Internet Forum to Counter Terrorism \(GIFCT\) where statutory law requires an underlying) Tj
T* (criminal act dangerous to human life.) Tj
